<title>SOUTH AFRICA: IBCA upgrades Group Five long-term rating.</title>
<headline>IBCA upgrades Group Five long-term rating.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>International rating agency IBCA on Monday changed to BBB the long-term domestic rating of Group Five Ltd from BBB-.</p>
<p>Group Five's short-term A3 domestic rating was reaffirmed.</p>
<p>IBCA said the long-term rating had been upgraded by a notch in view of the company's stronger financial position and favourable long-term prospects,</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
